## 📊 Component — Business Analytics & KPI Generation

### Purpose

The Business Analytics component transforms validated financial transactions into high-value analytical datasets that support financial monitoring, fraud analysis, and executive reporting. Rather than exposing individual transaction records, the Gold layer summarizes financial activity into meaningful business metrics that are easier to interpret and visualize.

The aggregation process computes customer-level transaction behavior, fraud category distributions, and daily operational statistics, providing a comprehensive view of transaction health across the financial ecosystem.

These business-ready datasets significantly reduce analytical complexity while improving dashboard performance and enabling faster decision-making for compliance teams, auditors, and business stakeholders.

### 🔍 Key Responsibilities

* Reads validated transaction records from the clean_transactions Silver table.
* Generates user-level transaction summaries for approximately 10,000 customers.
* Calculates transaction counts, total deposits, withdrawals, and overall transaction volume.
* Computes average, maximum, and minimum transaction amounts for each customer.
* Measures suspicious and invalid transaction percentages at the customer level.
* Produces fraud distribution statistics across all fraud categories.
* Calculates daily financial KPIs for operational monitoring.
* Creates optimized analytical data marts for reporting and dashboard visualization.

